BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 590.00 Tm (The most expensive failures come from walkthroughs that skip the boring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 574.77 Tm (questions. Commercial Cleaning CEO watched a client lose a $20,000/mo) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 559.55 Tm (industrial account by not knowing that some zones need cleaning up to 6x a day,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 544.32 Tm (and that the 'communication hallway' break room runs 4x versus 2x elsewhere.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 529.10 Tm (The fix is to request the existing workload chart and build the plan in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 513.87 Tm (30-60-minute blocks [8jCIs_UmQ1Q @ 00:11:55]. Wastewater disposal is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 498.65 Tm (next trap. Crews have walked hundreds of yards through a plant just to change) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 483.42 Tm (mop water, so map dump sites during the walk, including unused showers or a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 468.20 Tm (truck that can serve as a dump [8jCIs_UmQ1Q @ 00:13:37]. Check equipment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 452.97 Tm (condition so you are not forced to buy a $50,000 ride-on to clean their floors,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 437.75 Tm (and note the broken truck before it becomes your problem. Deactivate badges on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 422.52 Tm (turnover, or the client will be very upset [8jCIs_UmQ1Q @ 00:15:21]. Paper) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 407.30 Tm (bids hide the same kind of landmine. Read the entire RFP, resolve conflicts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 392.07 Tm (against your walkthrough notes and check the delivery rules. On a roughly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 376.85 Tm ($400k/yr bid, the document required only a name and a signed policy, a detail) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 361.62 Tm (that skimmers miss entirely [-IxCGolievQ @ 00:17:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 346.40 Tm (Porter accounts bleed out through pay and scope rather than through bad) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 331.17 Tm (cleaning. OctoClean's Matt and Greg warn against bidding anywhere near) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 315.95 Tm (minimum wage: pay $15 and bill $16 and 'you just lost three.' Paying an extra) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 300.72 Tm ($2/hr beats the churn that a cheap porter triggers [52I2LNERY3E @ 00:20:41].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 285.50 Tm (Scope creep is the account killer: desk-to-desk cleaning, refilling copy paper,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 270.27 Tm (fetching sodas. Never hand the porter's cell number to the client. Two-way radios) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 255.05 Tm (routed through an office switchboard keep every request flowing through the) Tj ET
